commit 3fb75a1b6fc66821ab4894c194271a51577d8903
Author: Lars <lars@offshorly.com>
Date:   Mon Mar 30 17:52:58 2026 +0800

    feat: add early preview support with force_preview flag and preselected bundle/intent
    
    - Add `preselected_bundle_key` and `preselected_intent` to session model for skipping AI classification
    - Add `force_preview` flag to enable preview generation with incomplete data
    - Add `warning` field to AppPayloadResponseSchema for early preview notifications
    - Extend InterpreterService with `extract_only` method to bypass classifier when bundle is preselected
    - Add intent boost mechanism in classifier to prioritize bun

